/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (One of its key products, the ESB-R Green- Agnika10, is a 10-inch smokeless biomass stove designed for small businesses such as tea/coffee stalls, samosa/kachori vendors, and PG houses. Made from durable mild steel \(MS\), it offers a long lifespan, features a 4-inch AC fan, and includes a flame adjustment option to enhance cooking efficiency and control.)
/E (One of its key products, the ESB-R Green- Agnika10, is a 10-inch smokeless biomass stove designed for small businesses such as tea/coffee stalls, samosa/kachori vendors, and PG houses. Made from durable mild steel \(MS\), it offers a long lifespan, features a 4-inch AC fan, and includes a flame adjustment option to enhance cooking efficiency and control.)
/Pg 7 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
